{"time": 1771900905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703315240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "母亲眨了眨眼，\"小露，同学不是打招呼吗？\""}
