{"time": 1771900967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957556791", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"什么同学，哪里有其他人...妈妈你在说什么啊...我们快点走吧...我..好难受\"脸色有些难看"}
{"time": 1771900974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77201381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "星野鸫对着你妈妈开口，“姐姐，露酱是不是身体不舒服呀”"}
