{"time": 1772175576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428049806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是的，你已经在寂静岭里了)"}
{"time": 1772175607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287523928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在能挂号吗....”"}
{"time": 1772175711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539492954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "凌晨的医院有些寂寞无声，像是个耸立在黑暗里的巨人，尽管外墙的表皮已经有些剥落"}
{"time": 1772175735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804426931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有点害怕，不过妈妈在身边倒也无所谓"}
{"time": 1772175742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743554477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你们走进去，泛黄的里墙不免透露出岁月的沧桑"}
{"time": 1772175968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367147894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "和妈妈贴的更紧一些"}
{"time": 1772175969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566571286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "明晃晃的白炽灯点在走廊，门诊显得无比遥远。"}
{"time": 1772175997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726798365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在靠近一些“感觉怎么...有点...好冷清”"}
{"time": 1772176117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74977019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...毕竟是五点。\"妈妈低头看了一眼手表，\"快到六点了。\""}
{"time": 1772176507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964920028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉待会补一下)"}
{"time": 1772176518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962001474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（补什么）"}
{"time": 1772176548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047500162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我感觉好像...快没什么力气了..我们快点吧”"}
{"time": 1772265723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285715964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我在想我打不通电话，是不是因为别人的时间是从7点开始的（））"}
{"time": 1772265859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478635388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你可以猜猜看)"}
{"time": 1772265881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537105178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那他们现在不应该发现，自己手机有个未接来电（））"}
{"time": 1772277683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221835765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "半靠在妈妈身上去门诊那里"}
{"time": 1772278983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123299571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "门诊位于走廊的尽头，推开沉重的玻璃门，首先迎接你的是消毒水、旧榻榻米和某种说不清的腐朽气息混合而成的特有味道。候诊大厅的地砖是磨损的米黄色，塑料椅上三三两两坐着沉默的病人，天花板上挂着一个色彩有些斑驳的电视机，放着当下已不算时兴的电视剧。"}
{"time": 1772279013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459213223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看在哪里挂号"}
{"time": 1772279213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876264762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然，你母亲把你放在座位上之后，就去了前台的护士站挂号，两个护士看上去没什么精神，她们正在交谈着。"}
{"time": 1772279269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982633970", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "靠在靠背上，看着天花板，为什么今天会这么难受，是因为昨天在神社吗...星野x神社...摇摇头，不敢继续想了"}
{"time": 1772279296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038702059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "靠在靠背上，看着天花板，为什么今天会这么难受，是因为昨天在神社吗...那个牌子上的字，星野x...摇摇头，不敢继续想了..."}
{"time": 1772279320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150817857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但想到这里脑子里又不自觉想到早上的事情...希望今天不会有什么事"}
{"time": 1772279346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274041372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问个问题，那个忽视要做到那种程度，想都不能想，还是装作没看见就行（））"}
{"time": 1772279359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51446229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不给说明)"}
{"time": 1772279372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69230758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（坏）"}
{"time": 1772279401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "798373982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过了一下，你的母亲领着一个年轻的护士往你这边走来，\"小露，好好和这位姐姐说一下你的事情，好吗？\""}
{"time": 1772279592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818058665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐....我就是感觉身子好难受，头好痛...好累...好沉...”"}
{"time": 1772279623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479445023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后我一喝水...一喝水就感觉...”那种感觉仿佛又在猴头涌动，想要干呕"}
{"time": 1772279640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64078639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有原因吗？\"尽管护士的语气显得很困，不过她还是尽量打起了精神，\"水?近期被什么东西咬过?\""}
{"time": 1772279680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92478667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不...不知道...”摇摇头“不过...我昨天去学校后山了...好像踩到了什么，很恶心....不知道是什么”"}
{"time": 1772279751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217713256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"后山?\"护士低头思考了一下，\"那上面不是只有一个废弃的神社吗？\"你的母亲也跟着皱起了眉，\"去哪里干什么?\""}
{"time": 1772279941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186539515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“昨天..同学有事上去..我陪她一起去了.”"}
{"time": 1772279967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512121851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"护士摇摇头，\"没法判断出什么，很怕水?\""}
{"time": 1772280027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377053297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "努力平复了一下“我感觉一喝水....嘴里...就好像...有什么粘液一样的东西...”努力忍住，不过也没什么东西可以吐了"}
{"time": 1772280166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009329210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...难道被狗咬了?\"护士的眼睛扫过你的小腿和手臂"}
{"time": 1772280284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968902823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“狗....？不会吧....我没有被狗咬过...也没有狂犬病...”"}
{"time": 1772280295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590775116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（医生呢，怎么一直是护士再看）"}
{"time": 1772280312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "798551431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(差不多吧)"}
{"time": 1772280317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740509768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说明医生懒得看)"}
{"time": 1772280320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407329654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是差的多了？）"}
{"time": 1772280326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254566045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（护士哪能看出来）"}
{"time": 1772280330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367375451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你就不能猜一下为什么)"}
{"time": 1772280333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30974653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(而不是问我)"}
{"time": 1772280336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089906601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（大家都是这样吗（））"}
{"time": 1772280341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374224233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还是医生没睡醒）"}
{"time": 1772280350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682453642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你问我我也不会回答的)"}
{"time": 1772280354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170144882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1772280420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84277426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个症状很明显是狂犬病。\"护士皱眉，下了个判断，\"要打疫苗。\""}
{"time": 1772280462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299033914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不会吧...护士小姐你别吓我...狂犬病不是发病了致死率100％么”非常害怕，眼睛渗出了眼泪"}
{"time": 1772280529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051341649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不想死，我才16岁....呜呜呜”"}
{"time": 1772280537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062256240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"打了疫苗就不会有事了。\"护士的语气有些不耐烦，\"拖下去发病的话，我就不好说了。不过我推荐，留院观察一段时间，最起码要打退烧针。\""}
{"time": 1772280556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280925422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "母亲也有些紧张，握着你的手微微有些抖"}
{"time": 1772280601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834448029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呜呜呜...去..去哪打针..”事已至此还是先去打针吧"}
{"time": 1772280678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在这里打就行。\"护士盯了一下你的大腿，\"打在大腿上或者屁股上。\""}
{"time": 1772280938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177337383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(人呢)"}
{"time": 1772280943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012962826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“打腿上吧....”"}
{"time": 1772280966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095821919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉好痛，算了..."}
{"time": 1772280971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010940304", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "还是打屁股上吧"}
{"time": 1772280981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329857552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1041572232", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还是打屁股上吧”"}
